  "body": "In the codebase, we have a type `EventID`. As of this day, it does not accurately represent event IDs. If I understand correctly, we have three different formats for event IDs and only one of them matches `EventID`. Attempting to shoehorn an event ID in another format into `EventID` turns out to be the wrong path. In other words, this is highly misleading.\r\n\r\nI believe that we should fix `EventID` to accept these three formats and provide methods to ensure that the format is appropriate for a given context. The alternative would be to get rid of `EventID` and replace it with `str`.\r\n",
